Snapshots are stored losslessly using versioned, checksummed Zstandard level 1
compression by default. JSON snapshot APIs and NetCDF exports retain complete
contents, and legacy uncompressed snapshots remain readable. Set
``dataset.snapshot_compression`` to ``"none"`` for uncompressed writes.
Database schema version 10 prevents older QCoDeS versions from opening upgraded
databases; direct SQL consumers must account for the new BLOB representation.
